# Cloudflare local development secrets. Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in.
# `.dev.vars` is gitignored. Values here must always be empty.
#
# NOTE: `.dev.vars.example` is not a Cloudflare-documented convention — it is this
# template's extrapolation from `.env.example`. The mechanism it mirrors IS documented.
#
# TRAP: if a `.dev.vars.<environment>` file exists, ONLY that file is loaded and
# `.dev.vars` is skipped entirely. Every secret must then be redefined in it.
#
# Non-secret configuration belongs in `[vars]` in wrangler.jsonc, not here.
# Production secrets are set with: wrangler secret put <KEY>

# Example — replace with the project's real bindings.
API_SIGNING_KEY=
